<section class="policy-page"><span class="micro">END CULTURE / HELP</span><h1>RETURNS</h1><div class="policy-copy"><p>If you change your mind, you can request a return within 14 days of receiving your order. Once a return has been requested, you then have 14 days to send the item back.</p><p>Items should be unworn, unused and returned in their original condition with any tags attached. This does not affect your rights if an item is faulty, damaged or not as described.</p><p>To start a return, contact us with your order number before sending anything back. Unless the item is faulty or we have made an error, return postage is the customer's responsibility.</p></div></section>{% schema %}{"name":"Returns","settings":[]}{% endschema %}